<title>USA: AMEX to list options on Medicis.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list options on Medicis.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Monday it would list options on Medicis Pharmaceutical Corp on October 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said Medicis options will have opening strike prices of 45, 50 and 55. The stock was down 1/4 at 49 Monday morning.</p>
<p>Initial expirations will be October, November, January and April, the exchange said.</p>
<p>It said Group One Trading LP will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
